<title>JAPAN: Indonesia July Minas price at $17.56/bbl--traders.</title>
<headline>Indonesia July Minas price at $17.56/bbl--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude  oil for July lifting was calculated at $17.56 per barrel, down 21  cents from June, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Indonesia state oil company Pertamina altered the calculation of its  Bunyu grade, bringing it to parity with Minas compared with Minas  minus 30 cents per barrel previously.</p>
<p>Prices for additional grades, and a retroactively revised June Bunyu  price, follow in dollars per barrel:  </p>
<p>    TYPE		  JULY	    JUNE</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  17.78	   18.39</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	17.93	   18.47</p>
<p> Attaka		   18.48	   19.09</p>
<p> Cinta		    16.73	   17.03</p>
<p> Duri		     16.32	   16.33</p>
<p> Handil		   17.56	   17.77</p>
<p> Lalang		   17.61	   17.82</p>
<p> Widuri		   16.61	   16.90</p>
<p> Belida		   18.26	   18.97</p>
<p> Anoa		     18.88	   19.49</p>
<p> Badak		    18.48	   19.09</p>
<p> Bekapai		  18.48	   19.09</p>
<p> Bunyu		    17.56	   17.77</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     16.55	   16.76</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    17.73	   18.27</p>
<p> Walio		    17.36	   17.57</p>
